cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "如果你在研究中使用了 RadStudio Local，请引用本文件。"
title: "RadStudio Local: reproducible radiomics workflows on your own machine"
abstract: >-
  RadStudio Local 是面向医学影像组学研究的本地可复现工具：统一 Workflow IR、
  可独立运行的 Python 算子与复现包，数据留在本机，产物可核对。
authors:
  - name: "RadStudio Team"
    affiliation: "RadStudio"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-12-15"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/RadStudioTeam/RadStudio-Local"
keywords:
  - radiomics
  - medical imaging
  - reproducibility
  - workflow
  - IBSI
